          "description": "Join Rebecca and Momo McSquirrel as they bring traditional virtues to modern kids through fun and engaging stories! Young hearts and minds are formed by the stories they are told which is why each original episode will highlight a traditional virtue such as courage, grace, and beauty along with fun, original songs! Simple discussion questions are asked at the end of each episode to help kids think through the virtues presented in the story.\nIf you're interested in subscribing to Letters from Momo, please visit: www.lamplighterkids.com\n*We're not associated with Lamplighter Ministries",
